data/*.csv
# Notes-Extraction-Separated.csv is the exception — the live server reads it directly off disk
# on every request (SCENT_CONTAINERS in chat.jsx, the Fuse.js catalog in scentEngine.server.js),
# so it must actually ship with deployed builds, unlike order_history.csv/notes.csv which are
# one-time seed inputs only ever read locally by scripts/seed-notes.cjs.
!data/Notes-Extraction-Separated.csv